ildren":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["打人或者故意伤害的，拘留 5 到 10 日，并罚 500 到 1000 元。结伙打、打残疾人孕妇老人小孩、多次打或者一次打好几个人的，拘留 10 到 15 日，并罚 1000 到 2000 元。打成轻伤就是故意伤害罪，判 3 年以下有期徒刑、拘役（短期关押）或者管制（不关押但行动受限）。打成重伤的判 3 到 10 年。民事上还要赔医疗费、误工费（耽误上班少挣的钱）、护理费、交通费、住院伙食补助费、营养费。把人打残的，另外赔残疾赔偿金。残疾赔偿金的算法，是审案法院所在地上年度城镇居民人均可支配收入乘 20 年。伤者 60 岁以上的，每多一岁减一年，75 岁以上按 5 年算。2022 年全国检察机关受理轻伤害案件 7 万余件，多数是婚姻家庭邻里纠纷或者偶然事件引起的。最高检典型案例：卢某打断对方三根肋骨（轻伤二级），赔了 11.3 万元达成和解，才获不起诉。石某打断对方桡骨（轻伤二级），没有赔，判有期徒刑十个月（全国，治安管理处罚法 2026 年 1 月 1 日起施行）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2025). 治安管理处罚法（2025 年修订，第九、五十一条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202506/t20250627_699863.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202506/t20250627_699863.shtml"]},"；全国人大 (1997). 刑法（第二百三十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/201802/t20180206_364975.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/201802/t20180206_364975.shtml"]},"；最高人民法院 (2022 修正). 关于审理人身损害赔偿案件适用法律若干问题的解释（法释〔2022〕14 号，第六至十二、十五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/357071.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/357071.html"]},"；最高人民检察院、公安部 (2023). 关于依法妥善办理轻伤害案件的指导意见. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/xwfbh/wsfbt/202303/t20230302_604352.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/xwfbh/wsfbt/202303/t20230302_604352.shtml"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2023). 检察机关依法妥善办理轻伤害案件典型案例. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/dxal/202303/t20230302_605116.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/dxal/202303/t20230302_605116.shtml"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["怎么避免冲突、先动手为什么吃亏、正当防卫的边界在哪，见第 8 节第 10 条（冲突和正当防卫）。为了泄愤对人下手的账，见第 8 节第 11 到 14 条。因民间纠纷引起、情节较轻的打架，公安可以调解。打成轻伤的，跟对方谈妥赔偿并且真赔了，可以从轻，甚至不起诉，但赔的钱一分都少不了。伤到什么程度算轻伤，由鉴定标准定，本节没有核实。误工费、护理费按实际收入和耽误的天数算，没有统一数字。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/09-18"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"对方不满 14 岁就不能发生关系，「她同意」不是理由"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/09-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"孩子生下来养不了，只有民政登记这一条合法出路：收钱把孩子给人可能按拐卖罪判，扔下不管是遗弃罪"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"ch